# #174 fix: the control plane embeds this one doc via include_str! (served at /llms.txt), so it MUST
# be in the build context. `docs/**` (not `docs/`) keeps the dir traversable so this re-include works
# even though the rest of docs/ (and all *.md) stays excluded; placed LAST so it overrides both.
!docs/agent-onboarding.md
# Same reason: the legal pages (Impressum/Datenschutz/Nutzungsbedingungen) are embedded via
# include_str! and served live -- must be in the build context too.
!docs/legal/
!docs/legal/*.html
# Same reason: the human "publish your service" onboarding page (served at /publish).
!docs/landing/
!docs/landing/*.html
